WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.335
-You guys,
here at "Late Night,"

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.103
every night
I deliver a monologue.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.638
That monologue is
comprised of jokes

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.740
written by our very diverse
team of writers.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.543
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.512
due to being
a straight white male,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.147
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:17.116
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:19.218
so we'd like to share them with
you now, in a segment called

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:20.686
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:24.390 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.292
These are two of our writers,
everybody.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.427
That's Amber.

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:30.964
That's Jenny.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.866
-I'm black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.601
-And also women.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:38.004
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:40.106
-Okay.
I'll get it next time.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.142
-We've only done this bit
7,000 times.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:45.644
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:47.379
Which one did you
think you were?

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:49.014
[ Indistinct talking ]

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:50.984
-"And we're both women."
That's not my line?

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.785
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.887
Got to be clearer
on the cards.

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:56.588
All right, guys,
here's how this works --

00:00:56.588 --> 00:00:58.157
once I stop
being interrupted.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:01.394
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.229
I'll read the setups
for these jokes,

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.365
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:06.432
Here we go.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.667
"Designer brand
Yves Saint Laurent

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.004
has released
a new line of jewelry

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.539
that includes
penis earrings."

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:16.809
-"Said lesbians --
'Ugh, earrings.'"

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.312
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.447
-"A Democratic pollster
said recently

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.082
that there was
a significant gap

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.151
in how white women
and black women voted

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.619
in the midterm elections."

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:29.522
-"For example -- black women
went to their polling places."

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.025
-"And white women
called the cops on them."

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:33.493
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.632
-"On New Year's Day,
the LA Clippers

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.568
hosted an LGBT
Pride Night."

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.138
-"But it was mostly Ls."

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.573
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.809
-"The ACLU
has filed a lawsuit

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.978
on behalf of
a Philadelphia-born man

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.979
who says he was detained
for three weeks

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:56.849
while ICE agents tried to
deport him to Jamaica."

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:57.984
-"Said black people --

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.019
'Y'all giving pout
free trips to Jamaica?'"

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:03.155
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.391
-Amber, have you ever
been to Jamaica?

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.660
-No. But I have braided
a white lady's hair,

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.296
so I'm practically
Jamaican.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:12.064
-Which white lady?
-That one.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:13.866
-How do I look?
-White.

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:15.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.537
-"Scottish Parliament
officially changed the name

00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:21.106
of 'gingerbread men'
to 'gingerbread people'

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:22.909
to make them
gender-neutral."

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.378
-"And that's great.
But they leave crumbs everywhere

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.881
and they don't wear pants, so
I'm pretty sure they're men."

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:30.382
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:33.519
-"According to a recent article,
a movie is in the works

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:35.354
about the life of
Rosa Parks."

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:37.623
-"The article was originally
on the front page,

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:39.491
but it was asked to move
to the back."

00:02:39.491 --> 00:02:42.395
[ Crowd "oh"s ]

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.565
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:46.933
-I think I could have
told that one.

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:52.171
"A state senator
from Colorado

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:53.940
resigned recently
amid accusations

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.009
that he frequently used
the women's restroom at work."

00:02:57.009 --> 00:02:59.345
-"Officials became suspicious
when he was suddenly

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:02.181
up on all
the office gossip."

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:04.517
-Oh, so, women really gossip
in the restroom?

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.819
-Yes. Where do you think
Amber and I talk about you?

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.387
-Right in front of my face.

00:03:08.387 --> 00:03:09.789
-That's true.
-We also do that.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.924
I think he's gained weight.
-He's eating his feelings.

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:14.327
-I can hear you.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:15.995
And it's muscle.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.097
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.333
"According to a recent article,
a restaurant in Japan

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:24.103
has started selling a new line
of girl's-hair-flavored

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:25.504
fried chicken."

00:03:25.504 --> 00:03:28.274
-"Said black people...

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:29.842
'Let me try it.'"

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:30.977
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:32.645
-You'd eat that?
-I don't know.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:36.582
My hair smells like coconut oil.
It'd probably taste great.

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:38.851
-"Rapper Post Malone announced
that he has designed

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.886
a special pair of Crocs."

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:43.556
-"Said lesbians --
'All Crocs are special.'"

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.491
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.459
-"According to new research,
one in five Americans

00:03:47.459 --> 00:03:49.795
would rather spend
one hour in jail

00:03:49.795 --> 00:03:52.498
than work out a five-year
financial budget."

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:55.034
-"One hour in jail --
or, as white people call it,

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.904
'a murder conviction.'"

00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:00.773
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:03.676
-Seth, why don't you --
-No!

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.311
-Come on!
-I really don't think
this will end well.

00:04:06.311 --> 00:04:07.580
-Oh, come on.
-Just one, boy.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.482
-Okay, okay, okay.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:12.618
"A company has begun selling
fashionable hospital gowns

00:04:12.618 --> 00:04:14.887
for pregnant women to wear
while giving birth.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:18.758
'Oh, you look beautiful,'
said a husband who was lying."

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.058
-How dare you!

00:04:20.058 --> 00:04:22.028
-You told me it
would be okay!

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:23.829
-You should be
ashamed of this!

00:04:23.829 --> 00:04:26.065
-Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:30.570 line:0%
♪♪

